  backgroundNameEn: "Spirit Investigator"
  descriptionEn: "Your master sensed that the spiritual energy in this region has fallen out of balance and sent you to look into it. Before you left, your master gave you a brocade pouch and told you to open it only when your life hangs in the balance.\n\nTake the Brocade Pouch card from the item pile."
